  "title": "App Designer writes nothing when a PeopleCode program does not compile",
  "statement": "When App Designer cannot compile a PeopleCode program, it refuses the save (a syntax error message with only OK) and writes no row and moves no counter: it never stores source the compiler rejected, so PSPCMTXT is never ahead of PSPCMPROG. The sweep's no-op control (00-noop) is empty too, so an empty delta is not an artifact.",
